  (text "ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 (N16R8: 16MB flash, 8MB octal PSRAM). Powered\nvia its 5V pin from the boost converter (see POWER); the onboard\nLDO supplies +3V3 to every module. Devkit USB-C = flash/console\nonly (native USB-Serial-JTAG on GPIO19/20).\nReserved, never use: GPIO3/45/46 (strapping), 19/20 (USB), 22-25\n(absent), 26-32 (flash), 33-37 (PSRAM), 43/44 (UART0)." (at 30.48 93.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "04d1f3ec-fa80-47b8-8d9b-ea6b042403c4"))
